<section class="about">

    <h1>About MovieFlix</h1>

    <p>
        MovieFlix is a Movie Recommendation Website developed as a BCA Mini Project.
        Users can explore movies, search by title, view details, rate movies,
        write reviews, and maintain a personal watchlist.
    </p>

</section>

